# anthropic_agent (Data Source)

Retrieves a Managed Agent by ID.

> **API**: `GET /v1/agents/{id}` (Managed Agents API).
> **Auth**: Standard API key (`api_key` / `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`).
> **Beta header**: `anthropic-beta: managed-agents-2026-04-01`.
> **Cost**: Free.

